## API access

The API is read-only for anonymous callers: `GET` works without signing in, and
writes need an authenticated user.
[[- if .DRF]] Sign in at `/api-auth/login/` and the browsable API shows the create
and edit forms. To make the demo API writable without signing in, set
`DEFAULT_PERMISSION_CLASSES` to `rest_framework.permissions.AllowAny`.
[[- else]] Writes use Django session authentication and answer 401 until you sign in
at the admin. To make the demo API writable without signing in, remove
`auth=django_auth` from the write operations in `[[.AppName]]/api/router.py`.
[[- end]]
[[- end]]
